      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Let me look at the `EnumHeader` and `EnumFixture` types used in the test.Let me check if `EnumHeader` and `EnumFixture` exist as standalone files in the test directory.Let me check the compile script and working directory setup.Let me check the compiled test-classes directory to understand what's available.Let me look at the `CSVRecordTest_testToString` file to see how it handles the inner enums.Now I have a clear picture. The improved test needs to:\n1. Define `EnumHeader` and an unmapped-column enum as nested types (they're inner classes of `CSVRecordTest`, not standalone)\n2. Remove unused fields (`record`, `headerMap`, `values`), unused helper method (`validateMap`), and all unused imports\n3. Keep only what's needed for the single `testGetUnmappedEnum` test\n\nLet me write the improved test."
